  "slug": "expense-reimbursement-incident-report-form",
  "title": "Expense Reimbursement Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Use this incident report to stabilize the event, preserve facts and evidence, analyze contributing factors, assign corrective work, and verify closeout for a expense reimbursement workflow.",
  "description": "An original operational expense reimbursement incident report form that controls a employee business-expense claim and substantiation record from identity and routing through evidence, qualified decision, exception management, implementation, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when the employee claimant, manager, or expense processor needs a traceable incident report so the authorized manager, finance, payroll, tax, or compliance reviewer can reimburse, partially reimburse, return, deny, recode, offset an advance, or escalate the claim under the current expense policy, approval limits, receipt and substantiation rules, project coding, and applicable tax requirements without relying on an informal email, spreadsheet, or unreviewed narrative.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
